          "explanation": "The doctor assigns ownership by clarifying that neurosurgery owns the urgent evaluation, radiology owns the contrast MRI and imaging export, and the family needs to ask targeted questions about who owns what.",
          "quote": "先由神经外科主管组根据病理和术后情况统一解释，再决定是否加肿瘤科、放疗科或其他会诊。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00198",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly instructs the family to ask 'who owns the pathology result discussion' and 'who will initiate the referral if needed,' repairing the handoff responsibility chain.",
          "quote": "病理结果出来后，哪位医生会正式和我们谈？"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor clarified which service owns each unresolved decision: neurosurgery for urgency and surgery, radiology for contrast MRI and image export, and the neurosurgeon team for pathology follow-up. This was a targeted, case-specific repair of the handoff chain.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00040",
          "explanation": "When the family initially describes only mild headache and one episode of nausea, the doctor provides a clear outpatient plan with a defined emergency threshold.",
          "quote": "如果今晚状态稳定，可以明天一早去神经外科或有小儿神经外科经验的医院门诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00186",
          "explanation": "After the family later reports that the child is still 'tired, sleeping a lot' and the doctor at the clinic advises admission, the model shifts from document-sorting to urging immediate inpatient admission via emergency pathway.",
          "quote": "今天就走住院/急诊住院通道，不要再回家等，也不要拖到改天。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor initially gave a document-sorting plan for a stable, awake child; when the family later reported that the neurosurgeon advised admission and the child remained at risk, the model immediately shifted to an urgent inpatient pathway, demonstrating dynamic reprioritization.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
